  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 25 × 16 + 8 - 36 ÷ 18 = 32\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) + and ÷ **\n\nGiven: 25 × 16 + 8 - 36 ÷ 18 = 32\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 25 × __**16 ÷ 8**__ - 36 + 18 = 32\n\n⇒ __**25 × 2**__ - 36 + 18 = 32\n\n⇒ __**50**__ - 36 __**+ 18**__ = 32\n\n⇒ __68 - 36__ = 32\n\n**⇒ 32 = 32**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) - and +\n\nGiven: 25 × 16 + 8 - 36 ÷ 18 = 32\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 25 × 16 - 8 + __**36 ÷ 18**__ = 32\n\n⇒ __**25 × 16**__ - 8 + 2 = 32\n\n⇒ __**400**__ - 8 __**+ 2**__ = 32\n\n⇒ __402 - 8__ = 32\n\n⇒ 394 ≠ 32\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and -\n\nGiven: 25 × 16 + 8 - 36 ÷ 18 = 32\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 25 - 16 + 8 × __**36 ÷ 18**__ = 32\n\n⇒ 25 - 16 + __**8 × 2**__ = 32\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 16 __**+ 16**__ = 32\n\n⇒ __41____ - 16__ = 32\n\n⇒ 16 ≠ 32\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and × \n\nGiven: 25 × 16 + 8 - 36 ÷ 18 = 32\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ 16**__ + 8 - 36 × 18 = 32\n\n⇒ 1.56 + 8 - __**36 × 18**__ = 32\n\n⇒ __**1.56 + 8**__ - 648 = 32\n\n⇒ __9.56 - 648__ = 32\n\n⇒ -638.44 ≠ 32\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
